+<p>I also verified against the <strong>full RFC 8439 Appendix A vectors</strong> (5 ChaCha20 block vectors, 11 Poly1305 vectors including the <code>r=0</code>, <code>2^130-5</code>, and 131-bit-reduction edge cases, and the 265-byte A.5 AEAD decryption vector) and against an independent oracle:</p>
